# MiMo-V2.6-Pro on two Stations, six tiers + rank-0 routing broadcast (the X2 re-run's X2-S6 stack), plus the
# checkpoint's own MTP layer as the speculative drafter. One session, 2026-10-11 01:42-04:14 PT. Arms in order:
# X3-S6 = same-session control (no drafting), X3-MTP1 = --speculative-config {"method":"mtp","num_speculative_tokens":1},
# X3-MTP2 = the same with 2 (vLLM applies MTP layer 0 twice). Pre-registered bars: V-X3 knee C16 ratio >= 1.05, V-X3-C1
# >= 1.20. The 8192/1024 random-token bench was pre-registered as not run (public real text replaces it), hence "NA".
# The knee prompts start with a ~12-token nonce. The soak that followed is in logs/mimo/x3-soak.log.
# Excerpt: lines selected verbatim from the raw files named below; hostnames, IPs, user names, GPU UUIDs, network
# device names, file-system paths and the names of the services stopped for the run replaced with <placeholders> or
# their lines omitted. Nothing else edited. Times are Pacific (PT) unless the line says otherwise (vLLM's own log stamps
# are UTC = PT + 7 h).

